Quick save and quick load always use slot 07

F6 saves into slot 07 and F7 loads from it, every time, without the
window that asks for a slot: the page offers both as buttons, and a
button cannot answer a question. The quick save is described as
"QUICKSAVE hh:mm". A quick load with nothing in slot 07 that can be
read leaves the game as it is. Loading a save at start-up still goes
through the quick load, with its own slot.

Both tell the page how they went (engines/lib/overseer.js).
